摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A standalone SearXNG-backed web search provider for the DeepSeek Harness web profile. It plugs into the harness's web-search seam (ctx.web), so the agent's web_search tool searches through your own self-hosted SearXNG instance instead of a vendor API.","id":"gh:1334480377","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-web-search-searxng","slug":"d3cker/dsh-web-search-searxng","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-v4-flash-0731","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","open-source","opensource","searxng","self-hosted"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A standalone SearXNG-backed web search provider for the DeepSeek Harness web profile. It plugs into "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"the harness's web-search seam (ctx.web), so the agent's web_search tool searches through your own se"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"lf-hosted SearXNG instance instead of a vendor API."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-search-searxng"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A **standalone** SearXNG-backed web search provider for the DeepSeek Harness web profile. It plugs i"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"nto the harness's web-search seam (`ctx.web`), so the agent's `web_search` tool searches through **y"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"our own self-hosted SearXNG instance** instead of a vendor API."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- Plain ESM, **no build step.**\n- Ships as a **bundle**: one `dsh plugin` command installs **and** a"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ctivates it automatically.\n- Single configuration knob: `$SEARXNG_BASE_URL`.\n- Tested (`pnpm test`, "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"tically.\n- Single configuration knob: `$SEARXNG_BASE_URL`.\n- Tested (`pnpm test`, 20 tests, vitest)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## The one-command install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"From a fresh DeepSeek Harness checkout (or with `dsh` on PATH):"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"That's it. The plugin is automatically appended to the web profile's bundle stack and its patch laye"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"r (shipped in this repo as `cordis.patch.yml`):"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- switches the web seam to this provider (`searchProvider: searxng`), **and**\n- mounts the plugin ro"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"switches the web seam to this provider (`searchProvider: searxng`), **and**\n- mounts the plugin row."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"No `cordis.patch.yml` hand-editing. No rebuild."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Configure: set one environment variable"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Your SearXNG address is read from `SEARXNG_BASE_URL` (defaults to `http://localhost:8888`):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Optional knobs:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Variable | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `SEARXNG_BASE_URL` | `http://localhost:8888` | Your SearXNG instance; `/search` is appended. |\n| `"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"SEARXNG_NUM_RESULTS` | `10` | Default result count when a request doesn't specify its own bound. |\n|"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" `SEARXNG_API_KEY` | (none) | Optional, for instances behind a key. |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then start (or restart) `dsh web` in that shell — or add the exports to your shell profile / the `.e"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"nv` the harness loads."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**No environment variables?** Then edit the one line in the bundle's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Both ways produce the same result — the choice is yours."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"should return aggregated results from your instance."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Wait — will I get the Settings → Plugins card?"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Only after applying two small harness-side changes** (the card lives in the harness source itself,"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" and an allowlist gate in `api-proxy.ts` must name this namespace). They're documented at the end of"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" this README in Make the Settings card work. The search itself works without them."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Details"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Files"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### How the one command works"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`dsh plugin --profile web add` runs `pnpm add` inside the profile directory, then **reconciles the b"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"undle list**: any installed package declaring `dsh.bundle` in its `package.json` is appended to `dsh"},{"id":"p30s3","text":".profile.bundles` (harness `apps/cli/src/plugin.ts`, `reconcilePlugins`). This repo's `package.json`"},{"id":"p30s4","text":" declares exactly that, pointing at `cordis.patch.yml`, which is applied as the top layer over the b"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ase/web-app bundles."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Options at a glance"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Setting | Default | Via |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| `baseURL` | `http://localhost:8888` | `$SEARXNG_BASE_URL` env, or the patch line |\n| `numResults` "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"| `10` | `$SEARXNG_NUM_RESULTS` env, or the patch line |\n| `apiKey` | (none) | `$SEARXNG_API_KEY` en"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"v, or the patch line |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The plugin also exposes a `web-search-searxng` settings section, so once the Settings card is enable"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"d (below) those same fields become editable in the GUI and writes apply to the next search immediate"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"below) those same fields become editable in the GUI and writes apply to the next search immediately."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Running tests locally"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"`node_modules/` is git-ignored."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Make the Settings card work (optional)"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The editable card needs two changes **inside the harness** (they can't ship from a host-only plugin,"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" because the browser bundle of `ui-settings-plugins` and the settings exposure gate are part of the "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"harness). Both are small:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"1. **Expose the namespace** — in the harness, edit `packages/host/apiproxy/src/api-proxy.ts`:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"2. **Render the card** — in `packages/client/ui-settings-plugins`, add `SearxngCard`/`SearxngCardCon"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"troller` (endpoint + default result count), register it in `index.ts` (`settings.plugin.item` slot),"},{"id":"p42s3","text":" add the `searxng*` locale keys, then rebuild the web artifacts (`pnpm run build:lib:host` + `pnpm r"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"un build:lib:client` + `build:web`) and restart the GUI."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"> Without these two, everything works *except* the in-UI editor: search is live, config via env var "},{"id":"p43s2","text":"or the patch file. With them, you also get Settings → Plugins → Web search (SearXNG)."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"*Created with the DeepSeek Harness and DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731 running on 2 × Asus Ascent GX10.*"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
